       "Wind",
       "increasing · decreasing"
      ],
      [
       "Barometer",
       "falling · rising · steady"
      ],
      [
       "Visibility",
       "going down · improving"
      ]
     ],
     "paras": [
      "For weather that is changing <b>now</b>, use <b>is</b> + verb-ing, like in Lesson 10: <i>The barometer <b>is falling</b>.</i>",
      "The wind is given by where it comes <b>from</b>: <i>wind north-west</i> = from the north-west. Then the Beaufort <b>force</b>."
     ],
